    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u300aBook Shooter\u300bis a magic shooting game similar to rogue, tower defense, and vampire survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the mysterious forbidden area, you are awakened as a book, with a Bible that can do magic, advanced mathematics that can fight, and a The Emperor's New \uff08Clothes\u00d7\uff09Book\uff01</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The gods in the forbidden area want to devour you all the time. Open the magic book to learn magic, defeat the gods, and get the forbidden power.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551370/extras/ac36368ec60a10c13e874562b07b57b6.poster.avif?t=1755690077\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551370/extras/ac36368ec60a10c13e874562b07b57b6.webm?t=1755690077\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551370/extras/ac36368ec60a10c13e874562b07b57b6.mp4?t=1755690077\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551370/extras/1dc8c4851e730c38a7c5eba458c17d09.avif?t=1755690077\" width=607 height=219 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can freely match books, title pages, colleges, and concentration<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551370/extras/a3cc35a30f6cdadbba6926da8060c223.poster.avif?t=1755690077\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551370/extras/a3cc35a30f6cdadbba6926da8060c223.webm?t=1755690077\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551370/extras/a3cc35a30f6cdadbba6926da8060c223.mp4?t=1755690077\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551370/extras/22dfd1a1283cdf29045029cf0cc0d480.avif?t=1755690077\" width=600 height=255 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progressive challenges, diverse enemies and rewards, powerful enemies are waiting for you to challenge</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551370/extras/f698f31a6d09f9f43130e771194b396e.poster.avif?t=1755690077\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551370/extras/f698f31a6d09f9f43130e771194b396e.webm?t=1755690077\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551370/extras/f698f31a6d09f9f43130e771194b396e.mp4?t=1755690077\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551370/extras/7c36db199cacc68e5a7c1cb649fd5f4b.avif?t=1755690077\" width=601 height=205 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight the final boss, it's time to test you, remember not to panic!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551370/extras/e33d6fe475a8b306f3fa40f5f4cbb2e0.poster.avif?t=1755690077\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551370/extras/e33d6fe475a8b306